        "walkthrough": "`invoice(4)` enters `invoice` with `price = 4`. To evaluate its return expression, it calls\n`fee(4)`. That inner call returns 6. Back in `invoice`, adding 1 gives 7, which `invoice`\nreturns. The caller, line 5, receives 7.\n"
